---
import Legal from '../../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { analytics, owner } from '../../config/site';
---

<Legal
  title="Privacy policy"
  description="How this website processes personal data: hosting, contact form, no cookies."
  lang="en"
  routeKey="datenschutz"
  note="Draft. Not legally reviewed. The German version is authoritative. PLACEHOLDER_REVIEW"
>
  <h2>Controller</h2>
  <p>{owner.name}, {owner.street}, {owner.postalCode} {owner.city}, Austria. Email: {owner.email}</p>

  <h2>In short</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>This website sets no cookies.</li>
    <li>It loads nothing from third-party servers. Fonts are served from our own server.</li>
    <li>We only use contact form data to answer your request.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Hosting</h2>
  <p>
    The website is hosted by Netlify, Inc. (PLACEHOLDER_NETLIFY_ADDRESS, USA). When you visit, Netlify processes technically necessary
    data: IP address, date and time, page requested, browser and operating system. This is needed to deliver the site and protect it
    from attacks.
  </p>
  <p>Legal basis: legitimate interest in operating the website securely (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR).</p>
  <p>
    A data processing agreement is in place with Netlify. Transfers to the USA rely on PLACEHOLDER_REVIEW (EU-US Data Privacy Framework
    or standard contractual clauses, depending on Netlify’s current status). Log retention: PLACEHOLDER_LOG_RETENTION.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact form</h2>
  <p>
    When you submit the form, we process your name, email address, hotel, hotel website and, if provided, phone number and message.
    The form is transmitted via Netlify Forms and stored there. We receive an email notification.
  </p>
  <p>Purpose: answering your request and arranging a call.</p>
  <p>Legal basis: steps taken at your request prior to entering into a contract (Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR).</p>
  <p>Retention: PLACEHOLDER_REQUEST_RETENTION. After that we delete the request at Netlify and in our mailbox.</p>
  <p>A hidden field protects the form from spam. There is no CAPTCHA and no third-party service for this.</p>

  <h2>Statistics</h2>
  {
    analytics.enabled ? (
      <p>PLACEHOLDER_ANALYTICS_DESCRIPTION (cookieless only)</p>
    ) : (
      <p>We do not collect visitor statistics. There is no tracking and no analytics tool. PLACEHOLDER_ANALYTICS_DECISION</p>
    )
  }

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>This website sets no cookies and does not use local browser storage.</p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You have the right of access, rectification, erasure, restriction of processing, data portability and objection. Write to
    {' '}{owner.email}.
  </p>
  <p>
    You can complain to the supervisory authority. In Austria this is the Datenschutzbehörde, Barichgasse 40–42, 1030 Vienna,
    <a href="https://www.dsb.gv.at">www.dsb.gv.at</a>.
  </p>

  <p>Last updated: PLACEHOLDER_DATE</p>
</Legal>
